y of face value of Rs. 10/- each fully paid up into 10 (Ten) equity shares of   face value of Rs. 1/- each fully paid up on March 21, 2024. The record date for the said sub-division was fixed as April 18, 2024. Pursuant to split of shares the equity shares of the Company is   increased from 1,73,41,644 equity shares to 17,34,16,440 equity shares of face value Rs. 1/-. The basic & diluted EPS for the current & prior periods of standalone financial statements haven   been restated considering the face value of Rs. 1/- each in accordance with Ind AS 33  Earning per Share���.      6. These result have been prepared in accordance with SEBI (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 and Circulars issued from time to time.      7.Previous period's figures have been regrouped / reclassified wherever necessary to make them comparable with the current period's classification / disclosure.      8. The Financial Results are available on the Company's website. i.e. www.suratwwala.co.in and the website of BSE Limited and National Stock Exchange of India Limited i.e. www.bseindia.com   and www.nseindia.com respectively.", "re_desc_note_seg": "-", "re_dil_eps_bfr_exi": null, "re_dilut_eps_for_cont_dic_opr": "0.01", "re_diluted_eps": null, "re_excepn_items": null, "re_excepn_items_new": "0", "re_extraord_items": null, "re_face_val": "1", "re_face_value_debt": null, "re_from_dt": "01-JUL-2024", "re_goi_per_shhd": null, "re_grs_npa": null, "re_grs_npa_per": null, "re_inc_dre_sttr": "0", "re_income_inv": null, "re_int_dis_adv_bills": null, "re_int_earned": null, "re_int_expd": null, "re_int_new": "2.82", "re_int_ser_cov": "0", "re_minority_int": null, "re_net_profit": "21.84", "re_net_sale": "130.63", "re_notes_to_ac": "", "re_oper_exp": null, "re_oper_exp_bef_pro_cont": null, "re_oth": null, "re_oth_exp": "39.98", "re_oth_inc": null, "re_oth_inc_new": "76.67", "re_oth_oper_exp": null, "re_oth_pro_cont": null, "re_oth_tot_exp": "154.66", "re_paid_debt": null, "r